# SpendWise UI — Impeccable + Figma Mint

Before any UI change:

1. Run `node .cursor/skills/impeccable/scripts/context.mjs` and read `PRODUCT.md` + `DESIGN.md`.
2. Read `reference/product.md` (product register — dashboard/ledger UI).
3. Use tokens from `web/src/app/globals.css` — never hardcode hex in components.
4. Visual spec: `final Figma design/PFOS Web Screens.html` + `styles/tokens.css`.

## Color

- Body text: `ink-900` / `ink-600`. `ink-400` is meta/placeholder only.
- Mint accent on primary actions + active nav only (restrained).
- Money colors: `income`, `expense`, `invest`, `transfer`, `pending` + `-bg` pairs.

## Motion

- 150–200ms, ease-out exponential. State feedback only — no decorative page-load sequences.
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Buttons: hover + active press. Inputs: focus ring transition.

## Bans (Impeccable)

No gradient text, side-stripe borders, glassmorphism except Figma auth hero, identical card-grid slop, uppercase eyebrow on every section.

## Components

Reuse `web/src/components/ui/*` and `AppShell`. Match Figma screen layouts when building new routes.
